  part of S2; see `scanner-structural-correctness.mdc`.)
- **S3 (High) — done:** `SW1_PARALLEL_TOL_MINS` is 0 (exact-bar `sw1` match).
- **S11 (Low) — incomplete (deprioritized):** `smt5m_prices` exists as a
